  "purpose": "Free-running comparison of fast mode's previous prefill defaults (FP32 panel projections; BF16 attention with the online softmax) and its new ones (INT16-activation projections; BF16 attention with the static-shift softmax) on out-of-distribution and hard pages, run before the user made the new kernels the defaults. Teacher-forced agreement and speed are in docs/MODES.md and docs/PERFORMANCE.md; the held-out gate is reference/fast-defaults-gate-v1-*.",
