  "after_the_flip": "From 70dcefe on, plain --mode fast runs the new arm's kernels and --tune prefill-projections=fp32 --tune prefill-softmax=online the old arm's; the prefill-i16 knob no longer exists. Checked on the journal page (the same 1,140 tokens each) and by tests/modes.rs.",
  "procedure": "One fresh process per arm and page set, pages in the order listed below, every other setting the automatic default (max dimension 1536, the draft head, the repetition stop), each process under a shared hold on the host CPU lock. No timing is read from these runs. The page files ran from local copies with the SHA-256 listed; the user's images and their fried versions are tracked under tests/fixtures/stress/, the corpus pages and their fried versions are not.",
